{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I... I can tell you two are both meant for something greater. The other spirits gathered, I don't know much of you, but I still believe the same. I just don't think I can really compare. Maybe I'm just a bug to skitter around under tables and rocks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:13:31.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864540054533177384","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
