{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Be what you will be. I am not going to pretend that there are not bugs in this world. But I also won't pretend to understand those who accept that as their fate.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:14:54.414000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T16:16:30.457000Z","id":"864540402811011092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't *want* to accept it. I just don't know if I can do otherwise. You thought I had potential, and here I am, having fallen to my death after going where I really shouldn't have. ...oh, yeah, for everyone going to the port, sorry for the mess I made there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:17:13.878000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864540987765030913","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I thought I had potential, too, Roy. Are you going to tell me otherwise, just because I'm dead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:17:56.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541165450035221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
