{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(ill be afk just a bit longer)","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:18:49.122000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541387247583232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So long as there is a path forward, take it. That's what people who are worth something do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:18:59.845000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541432223760444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I fought... my way here... to find my purpose. I... found a friend.'","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:19:20.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541519225290753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Am I really one of those though? I just bunked myself in my airship hoping for the curfew to end.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:20:08.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541718350528563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Sometimes... the wisest path... is patience. I... don't know... why I know that...'","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:20:38.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541844306001940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“There are nights where even I don’t feel like fighting the police,” Talia reports sagely.","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:20:50.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864541896998780959","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You have not acted as though you have a destiny, this is true. But why should that constrain you going forward?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:21:38.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542097952866315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I... I don't know if I have an answer to that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:21:56.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542171389755402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you choose to come back, you will have conquered even death. Does someone without a destiny do that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:22:36.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542342743719956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'When Kukudh died... I nearly gave up. You helped me... in the most vulnerable... I've ever been... since I became... like this...'","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:22:57.368000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542428467953695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Then maybe that is something you need to find, still. It doesn't have to be anything grand. You speak of bugs as if they're worthless. But they feed other creatures, the lizards and frogs. Who in turn feeds the bigger predator in the chain of life. They are a part of the natural order. We all have a role to play in this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:24:02.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542703638020137","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't know why, but something in that 'destiny' brings up a blurred memory. I can't explain it, but... That is... not a place for a story to end. For any of us. I don't know what made me say that, but... I think I believe it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:24:09.361000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542730427170836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"And bugs have a much bigger part in nature than you're imagining.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:24:48.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542896526852146","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you truly do not have a destiny, then remain a spirit. But if you do come back, then strive. Prove you are worthy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:25:11.655000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864542991707275284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Small things... making a bit impact... fascinating...'","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:25:19.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864543022754168835","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
