{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"One is with swarm, and swarm is for each one.\"\n\"Swarm is no separate from the world around it.\"\n\"The swarm is free, but no more than any other swarm.\"\n\"The swarm only takes what it needs.\"\n\"Every day is a new day for the swarm.\"\n\n\"Mister Berrybringer. I thank you for your time. I wish to let the swarm live on, and to take it forwards.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:47:17.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864548552868495421","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
