{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"“I will... likely use others,” Talia says in that odd moment of sitting up and being alive again. She seems to remember something a moment after.\n“...but thank you.”","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:54:42.282000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864550418256494592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
