{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he then turns his head \"yes friend?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:55:14.300000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864550552549195847","reply_to_id":"864550386144247870","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I... ask...' voice weary, she switches to telepathy. ||Might I ask, how much water is needed? My airship is rather tired and battered as it is, and I am - of course - used to rot and decay. Would filling it be enough space?||","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:56:28.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864550864944889917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"he stands up and walks to a small pond and gets in \"enough so that the body might feel the ebb and flow.  A small bathtub would suffice\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:57:27.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864551111124713543","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'Thank... you.'\nbefore turning to Roy, ||If you need to, feel free to use the Nightingale to bathe. I have dealt with worse decay.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T16:58:39.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864551415048962058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Since when do you have enough water to fill an airship? Honestly, I was thinking of coming here. I might be able to get here before dusk, and I think being out here for it might be good for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:00:31.223000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864551881819815966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. ||Understandable. If... you would like lessons in meditation, I can teach you. I... don't exactly sleep.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:01:30.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864552128432439308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I won't turn down the offer, thank you. And thank you, mister Berrybringer. Perhaps soon I'll once again be able to create some of mine to share with you, if you don't mind. And thank you, everyone. I'll do what I can to not waste your kind words.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:03:58.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864552751467855942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"please, call me the mender.. it was the name i was given for this life.... and thank you... i would enjoy that greatly\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:06:26.024000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T17:06:50.398000Z","id":"864553369963986974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Mender. I will remember it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:13:09.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864555063787913236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"||...are you hungry? I don't need to eat, but I feel after an experience like this, you might. I believe initially I felt hunger, but could not sate it. And... I would like to compare experiences. I apologise for misleading you.||","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:13:37.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864555180539772928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't feel misled. But maybe a bit hungry.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T17:14:59.962000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864555525575147521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
