{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(thanks work, I didn't notice my hour has passed <@!237577351532249110>)\nRoy, feeling much better and calmer than before, emerges from the pond, gives a nod to the Mender, notices Sabrine by the entrance, and walks up to her.\n\nIt's hard to notice due to their size, but Roy's bugs seem to have slightly longer legs than they used to.","created_at":"2021-07-14T06:14:48.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864751769941442561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'How are... you doing? I awoke early... saw you leave.' she switches to telepathy. ||I hope my presence was not a burden. I wanted to give you advice before you began, meditation can be difficult in a change of circumstance, but I was not sure how to let you know I was here.||","created_at":"2021-07-14T06:26:56.441000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864754824133607434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
